Package: com.meowmeow.vcam.local.iphone8plus
Name: MeowVCam Local iPhone8Plus Prototype
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Local video camera source with video audio mixed into live microphone PCM. Volume up then volume down menu. No artificial file size or duration cap. Requires iOS build and device validation.
Maintainer: MeowVCam Project
Author: MeowVCam Project
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 16.7)
